"A votary is an Artonan sworn to a knight, such as Drusi-otta to Lind-otta."
"Votaries pride themselves on remaining in the shadow, guarding unseen."
"The System has no English for the word and renders it only as votary."
"Votaries are wizards serving as assistants and dedicated casters, often to a single knight."
"They fill education gaps, care for the knight, meet social duties, and may join in the field."
"Knights' spouses in siblingholds are often former votaries and experts in fields of magic."
